      "writtenOn": "2023-03-09T07:18:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Additionally two points:\n 1) The ANDRIOD_KABI_RESERVE values are held only for ABI changes that come in through LTS (so one option, submit this to -stable)\n \n 2) You probably should consume reserved fields from the top instead of the bottom.",
